1259	If LGU+ SIM is not showing network in OPPO, Redmi, or Vivo phones, here are common reasons and solutions, written in both English and Nepali mix for your easy use:\n\n🔧 Common Reasons (समस्या के कारणहरू):\nVoLTE not enabled (VoLTE सुरु गरिएको छैन)\n\nAPN not set correctly (APN सेट नगरेको वा गलत छ)\n\nNetwork Mode not set to LTE only (Network Mode LTE मा छैन)\n\nSIM not activated / blocked / damaged (सिम एक्टिभ नभएको वा ब्लक/ड्यामेज भएको)\n\nPhone not compatible with Korean LGU+ Band (फोन LGU+ नेटवर्कको Band सँग मिल्दैन)\n\n✅ Solutions (समाधानहरू):\n🔹 1. VoLTE Enable गर्नुहोस्\nFor most phones:\nजानुहोस् 👉 Settings\n\nक्लिक गर्नुहोस् 👉 Mobile Network / SIM settings\n\nLGU+ SIM छान्नुहोस्\n\nEnable गर्नुहोस् 👉 VoLTE / Enhanced 4G LTE Mode\n\n👉 If you don’t see VoLTE option, go to Phone Dialer and dial:\n*#*#86583#*#* → This will enable/disable VoLTE check.\n\n🔹 2. APN सेट गर्नुहोस्\nAPN सेटिंग:\nजानुहोस् 👉 Settings > SIM cards & mobile networks > LGU+ SIM\n\nजानुहोस् 👉 Access Point Names (APN) > नयाँ APN थप्नुहोस् (+)\n\nFill this:\n\nmakefile\nCopy\nEdit\nName: LGU+\nAPN: internet.lguplus.co.kr\nSave गर्नुहोस् र Select गर्नुहोस् यो APN लाई।\n\n🔹 3. Network Mode सेट गर्नुहोस्\nजानुहोस् 👉 Settings > Mobile Network > Preferred Network Type\n\nछान्नुहोस् 👉 LTE only or LTE/3G/2G (auto connect)\n\n🔹 4. सिम एक्टिभ छ कि छैन हेर्नुहोस्\nCheck गर्नुहोस् कि सिम activate भइसकेको छ कि छैन।\nIf not, go to 👉 mvno.ttgo.dev:5000 and activate.\n\n🔹 5. Korean Bands compatible छैन भने\nकहिलेकाहीँ पुराना मोबाइलहरूले Korean LTE Band (Band 1, 3, 5, 7, 8) सपोर्ट गर्दैनन्। त्यसैले सिम चल्दैन। Try with newer phones.	1	1	160	1	2025-07-16 03:12:23.054366	2025-07-16 05:25:52.977413	f	2	wamid.HBgNOTc3OTgyNTEyMjgyNBUCABEYEjlBMTZDMjlDNDE0Q0VBQjlGRgA=	0	\N	User	5	\N	{}	If LGU+ SIM is not showing network in OPPO, Redmi, or Vivo phones, here are common reasons and solutions, written in both English and Nepali mix for your easy use:\n\n🔧 Common Reasons (समस्या के कारणहरू):\nVoLTE not enabled (VoLT